            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Diane Osborne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I really enjoyed this recipe. I use it for Lemon Lush Pie ( Sour Cream) Pie. I substituted Walnuts for the coconut and added a little more flour. It's a great taste but as others have said watch it carefully it'll burn quickly!",
